  "description": "AMD GPU observability for LLM inference workloads. Mirrors the layout of the NVIDIA DCGM dashboard (llmkube-gpu-dashboard) but targets rocm-smi-exporter metrics on AMD Instinct / MI-series nodes. Use this dashboard on clusters where nodeSelector gpu.vendor=amd applies.",
